    "globalNotes": {
      "summary": {
        "root": {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "This is a build I created that achieved Tower 131 in season 15. Once fully built, I had 100% crit chance and attack speed as well as 60% lucky hit on holy bolt (the only way we proc purify via wreath of auric laurel). In effect holding down holy bolt (with the richochet node) causes a LOT of rapid fire purify (with the echo node) explosions everywhere. We also use flickerstep evades (which works with enigma's teleport evade) to rapidly cooldown fortress, making is basically always available - this gives us the huge damage buff, unstoppable and very helpful immunity windows. Our mythic infinity has huge multis on it as well as free permanent vulnerability and a very high crushing blow chance (I transfigured 20 item quality onto it, meaning 58% lucky hit chance to proc crushing blow).  We throw in aegis and holy light (with the node that makes the active generate fortify) for survivability. ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Note: I added a speedfarm variant. This one has also cleared tower 131. Surprisingly, phoenix is actually pretty amazing here - solid all damage multi, the fire resistance works with our SOJ for holy damage, and the fire spear on lucky hit procs constantly and does hundreds of billions by itself. This variant has 102% lucky hit chance on holy bolt, so it's truly an overwhelming amount of purify and fire spear procs everywhere.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "I note this planner reflects my actual gear, not the perfect/idealized version. Hence it's missing some things I never found that would've helped push higher: mythic griswold or furnace charm, flawless horadric gems, useful GAs on infinity, multi GA jewelry",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [],
              "direction": null,
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "paragraph",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 0,
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "style": "",
                  "text": "Too lazy to rebuild the paragon, but used these glyphs and boards: Honed, Sentinel, Judicator, Spirit, Canny /// Beacon, Castle, Relentless, Shield Bearer (IE, pretty standard stuff)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
